Yeah, a little nap won't hurt anybody.

356
00:33:22,623 --> 00:33:27,123
Manager says I should nap anyways, so it's fine...

357
00:33:48,123 --> 00:33:52,123
一番の宝物 ~Yui final ver.~
[Title: My Most Precious Treasure ~Yui final ver.~]

358
