390
00:40:09,693 --> 00:40:13,693
What a beautiful, touching song.

391
00:40:14,293 --> 00:40:18,193
You know what? I should probably add that to my showcase.

392
00:40:19,593 --> 00:40:23,893
My showcase?!

393
00:40:24,193 --> 00:40:27,493
Oh no! Flame on!

394
00:40:28,393 --> 00:40:32,593
Oh gosh, I'm going to be late for my showcase! What the fudge?!

395
00:40:33,393 --> 00:40:36,693
All right, my showcase, my showcase, my showcase!

396
00:40:36,693 --> 00:40:39,993
Open, ye door! Let's go! Come on!

397
00:42:14,993 --> 00:42:18,193
Rosarians!

398
00:42:18,193 --> 00:42:20,693
My Bloodflame Kingdom!

399
00:42:20,693 --> 00:42:23,193
How is the performance thus far?

400
00:42:23,193 --> 00:42:27,193
Let me know what you all think using the hashtag...

401
00:42:27,193 --> 00:42:31,693
#ERB3D! ERB 3D!

402
00:42:31,693 --> 00:42:34,193
What have you loved most thus far?

403
00:42:34,393 --> 00:42:39,693
Is it this beautiful theater, the Queen Mother Theater...

404
00:42:39,693 --> 00:42:43,193
...named after my mum? Hi, Mum! Hello!

405
00:42:43,493 --> 00:42:47,993
Was it Ollie's appearance, Flayon and Oga's voiceovers...

406
00:42:47,993 --> 00:42:51,993
...Kawaikute Gomen sung with ARMIS, Giri Giri with ZEA?

407
00:42:52,193 --> 00:42:55,893
Oh gosh, it'll make me stupidly-doopah happy...

408
00:42:55,893 --> 00:42:57,993
...hearing your thoughts!

409
00:42:58,093 --> 00:43:02,293
And by the way, I can see you all right now! Oh my gosh, I see you guys!

410
00:43:02,293 --> 00:43:06,493
I've seen you at the corner of my eye with a magical, invisible...

411
00:43:06,493 --> 00:43:10,693
...box made by the Rosarian invisible wizards!

412
00:43:11,293 --> 00:43:14,793
So I can see you all right now! Oh my gosh!

413
00:43:14,793 --> 00:43:20,393
This is crazy! What do you think about my 3D appearance, huh?

414
00:43:20,493 --> 00:43:24,893
Let me know in chat right now what poses you would like to see!

415
00:43:24,893 --> 00:43:28,193
Yeah, yeah, let me know! Yeah, let me know!

416
00:43:28,193 --> 00:43:30,993
While you're doing that, I'm going to go get Thorn!

417
00:43:30,993 --> 00:43:33,993
Yeah! It's the one, the only...

418
00:43:33,993 --> 00:43:36,693
...Thorn!

419
00:43:36,793 --> 00:43:38,893
Hello, I'm Thorn!

420
00:43:39,693 --> 00:43:43,193
Let's do a quick pose with Thorn, shall we?

421
00:43:45,493 --> 00:43:51,693
Hazzah! Hazzah!

422
00:43:52,993 --> 00:43:55,493
All right, let's see what you guys have put.

423
00:43:58,393 --> 00:44:00,493
A cat pose?

424
00:44:02,393 --> 00:44:06,493
All right, sure! Let me just put Thorn over here.

425
00:44:06,993 --> 00:44:10,693
Let's take the jacket off for this one. Flame off!

426
00:44:13,393 --> 00:44:18,693
Okay. I need to become... rawr-ra!

427
00:44:18,793 --> 00:44:22,693
Nya! Nya, nya!

428
00:44:22,693 --> 00:44:26,693
Nya! Nya, nya! Nya! Nya!

429
00:44:27,693 --> 00:44:28,993
T-pose?

430
00:44:29,093 --> 00:44:33,293
Okay! That one's easy!

431
00:44:33,293 --> 00:44:36,993
Yes! I shall assert my dominance on you all!

432
00:44:37,493 --> 00:44:39,693
Oh, you know what I want to do?

433
00:44:39,693 --> 00:44:41,393
I want to headpat you all!

434
00:44:41,393 --> 00:44:44,893
Come here! Headpat! Headpat, headpat, headpat!

435
00:44:44,893 --> 00:44:49,193
And hug! Hug! We must do this, we must... hug!

436
00:44:49,993 --> 00:44:54,193
Hug, hug! One more!

437
00:44:55,493 --> 00:44:58,093
We got to, we got to!

438
00:45:00,214 --> 00:45:01,414
What else have you got?

439
00:45:01,414 --> 00:45:03,014
Victory pose?

440
00:45:03,014 --> 00:45:04,414
Like this?

441
00:45:04,414 --> 00:45:05,714
Ha!

442
00:45:05,714 --> 00:45:08,214
Yes! I am victorious! For I am...

443
00:45:08,214 --> 00:45:11,714
...the queen of the Bloodflame kingdom!

444
00:45:13,214 --> 00:45:15,214
Yeah!

445
00:45:15,714 --> 00:45:17,214
I love you all very much too.

446
00:45:17,214 --> 00:45:19,714
I'm so happy you're all here.

447
00:45:20,714 --> 00:45:22,714
Oh gosh.

448
00:45:23,714 --> 00:45:26,214
Absolute cinema, yes.

449
00:45:27,714 --> 00:45:29,214
Okay.

450
00:45:30,014 --> 00:45:31,214
Oh, a twirl?

451
00:45:31,214 --> 00:45:33,014
Okay, we shall do a twirl.

452
00:45:33,014 --> 00:45:34,214
All right.

453
00:45:36,214 --> 00:45:37,214
Yes.

454
00:45:37,714 --> 00:45:39,214
A twirl.

455
00:45:39,714 --> 00:45:41,714
Woah!

456
00:45:43,014 --> 00:45:45,014
Is that okay?

457
00:45:45,014 --> 00:45:46,714
A twirl.

458
00:45:47,214 --> 00:45:48,714
Jazz hands.

459
00:45:49,214 --> 00:45:50,214
Spin!

460
00:45:50,214 --> 00:45:51,214
Spinna!

461
00:45:51,214 --> 00:45:52,714
Doina!

462
00:45:56,714 --> 00:45:58,714
Oh gosh. A curtsy. Oh, that's a good one.

463
00:46:00,214 --> 00:46:01,714
Like this?

464
00:46:03,714 --> 00:46:05,714
A curtsy.

465
00:46:08,214 --> 00:46:09,714
And a bow.

466
00:46:10,714 --> 00:46:13,014
Cute? Hey, you mean... you mean...

467
00:46:13,014 --> 00:46:14,714
...you mean powerful, right?

468
00:46:14,714 --> 00:46:15,714
Powerful.

469
00:46:15,714 --> 00:46:17,714
Powerful!

470
00:46:17,714 --> 00:46:21,214
Yes, yes, yes, powerful.

471
00:46:21,214 --> 00:46:22,214
Rawr!

472
00:46:22,214 --> 00:46:24,714
I know you guys also like my shocked face.

473
00:46:24,714 --> 00:46:27,714
So let me just think of something real, that's shocking.

474
00:46:30,714 --> 00:46:33,714
The frick?!

475
00:46:35,214 --> 00:46:37,714
What the frick?!

476
00:46:38,214 --> 00:46:41,714
What the frick? Time is nearly up for poses?!

477
00:46:42,714 --> 00:46:45,214
Oh, I guess it's time...

478
00:46:45,214 --> 00:46:48,214
...for the next song!

479
00:46:48,414 --> 00:46:50,214
Would you like to hear another song?

480
00:46:50,214 --> 00:46:52,714
Yes! Sure you do!

481
00:46:52,714 --> 00:46:55,214
All right, just wait one moment. I need some...

482
00:46:55,214 --> 00:46:57,214
...some bits and bobs for this one.

483
00:46:57,214 --> 00:46:58,714
All right.

484
00:46:59,214 --> 00:47:02,214
Some bits and the bobs, and the bobs and the bits.

485
00:47:05,214 --> 00:47:06,714
All right.

486
00:47:06,714 --> 00:47:08,714
Here we go. Here's the bits...

487
00:47:08,714 --> 00:47:10,214
...and the bobs.

488
00:47:10,214 --> 00:47:11,714
I have a stand.

489
00:47:11,714 --> 00:47:14,214
It's my mic! Look at that!

490
00:47:14,214 --> 00:47:16,214
And I have a guitar.

491
00:47:20,214 --> 00:47:22,214
Ha! I'm so かっこいい!
Ha! I'm so cool!

492
00:47:22,714 --> 00:47:24,214
All right.

493
00:47:24,214 --> 00:47:26,214
Let's go with a... with a cute...

494
00:47:26,214 --> 00:47:28,214
...I mean a powerful song next!

495
00:47:28,714 --> 00:47:30,714
Please listen to...

496
00:47:30,714 --> 00:47:34,014
わたしの恋はホッチキス
My Love is a Stapler.

497
00:47:34,214 --> 00:47:37,214
The next song is My Love is a Stapler.

498
00:47:37,214 --> 00:47:39,214
Let's go!

499
00:47:56,214 --> 00:47:58,214
なんてなんだろう
Why is it, somehow,

500
00:47:58,214 --> 00:48:01,014
気になる夜 キミへの
on this restless night,

501
00:48:01,014 --> 00:48:03,714
この思い便せんにね
these feelings towards you,

502
00:48:03,714 --> 00:48:06,714
書いてみるよ
I try writing them on stationery.

503
00:48:11,014 --> 00:48:13,014
もしかして
Could it be

504
00:48:13,014 --> 00:48:17,014
気まぐれかもしれない
that it's just a whim?

505
00:48:17,214 --> 00:48:20,714
それなのに枚数だけ
Even so, only the page count

506
00:48:21,014 --> 00:48:25,014
増えてゆくよ
keeps on increasing.

507
00:48:25,214 --> 00:48:27,714
好きの確率
If only there were a formula

508
00:48:27,714 --> 00:48:30,214
わりだす計算式
to calculate the chances of love,

509
00:48:30,214 --> 00:48:33,214
あればいいのに
that would be nice,

510
00:48:33,214 --> 00:48:35,714
いいのに
so nice...

511
00:48:39,714 --> 00:48:42,214
キラキラひかる願い事も
Both sparkling, shining wishes

512
00:48:42,214 --> 00:48:45,214
グチャグチャへたる悩み事も
and messy, depressing worries,

513
00:48:45,214 --> 00:48:48,214
そーだ ホッチキスで
that's it! With a stapler,

514
00:48:48,214 --> 00:48:51,714
とじちゃおう
let's staple them together!

515
00:48:51,714 --> 00:48:55,214
はじまりだけは軽いノリで
It started off just light-heartedly,

516
00:48:55,214 --> 00:48:58,714
しらないうちにあつくなって
but grew passionate before I knew it,

517
00:48:58,714 --> 00:49:02,714
もう針がなんだか通らない
and now the staples somehow won't go through.

518
00:49:02,714 --> 00:49:07,214
ララ☆また明日
La la, see you tomorrow.

519
00:49:24,714 --> 00:49:26,714
どうしようかな
What should I do?

520
00:49:26,714 --> 00:49:29,714
読み返すのはずかしい
It's embarrassing to read back,

521
00:49:29,714 --> 00:49:32,714
あれこれと便せんにね
even though I wrote all sorts of things

522
00:49:32,714 --> 00:49:36,214
書いたくせに
on the stationery.

523
00:49:39,714 --> 00:49:41,714
気持ちごと
Throwing these feelings

524
00:49:41,714 --> 00:49:45,714
ゴミ箱行きじゃなんだか
into the trash can feels kinda...

525
00:49:45,714 --> 00:49:49,214
この胸がせつないから
...painful for my heart,

526
00:49:49,214 --> 00:49:53,214
持っていようかな
so maybe I'll hold onto them.

527
00:49:53,714 --> 00:49:56,214
今の気持ちを表す
To express my current feelings,

528
00:49:56,214 --> 00:49:59,214
辞書にもない言葉さがすよ
I'll search for words not even in the dictionary.

529
00:50:00,235 --> 00:50:01,035
...ない
...not even in a dictionary,

530
00:50:01,035 --> 00:50:08,735
言葉探すよ
I'll search for words.

531
00:50:09,035 --> 00:50:11,935
ワクワクしちゃう計画とか
Whether it's an exciting plan,

532
00:50:11,935 --> 00:50:16,235
グダグダすぎる展開とか
or a development that drags on too much,

533
00:50:16,435 --> 00:50:23,235
全部ホッチキスでとじちゃおう
I'll staple them all together with a stapler!

534
00:50:23,735 --> 00:50:27,735
今日の出来事思い出して
Recalling today's events,

535
00:50:27,735 --> 00:50:31,735
いつも心がキュンとなって
my heart always feels a squeeze.

536
00:50:32,035 --> 00:50:37,235
もう針がないから買わなくちゃ
And since I have no more staples left, I gotta go buy some.

537
00:50:37,235 --> 00:50:40,235
ララ☆また明日
La la ☆ See you tomorrow!

538
00:51:08,435 --> 00:51:11,235
キラキラひかる願い事も
Sparkling and shining wishes,

539
00:51:11,235 --> 00:51:15,735
グチャグチャへたる悩み事も
and messy, tiresome worries,

540
00:51:16,035 --> 00:51:22,735
そうだホッチキスでとじちゃおう
that's right, I'll staple them together with a stapler!

541
00:51:23,235 --> 00:51:25,735
始まりだけは軽いノリで
Only the beginning felt light,

542
00:51:25,735 --> 00:51:30,035
知らないうちに熱くなって
while I wasn't aware, it got thick,

543
00:51:30,035 --> 00:51:34,735
もう針がなんだか通らない
and somehow the staple won't go through anymore!

544
00:51:35,235 --> 00:51:39,735
ララ☆また明日
La la ☆ See you tomorrow!

545
00:51:56,735 --> 00:51:58,435
Woo!

546
00:51:58,435 --> 00:52:02,235
And that was "My Love Is a Stapler"!

547
00:52:02,235 --> 00:52:05,735
How was it? Did you like my guitar playing?

548
00:52:06,735 --> 00:52:10,235
I... well, you guys didn't know this,

549
00:52:10,235 --> 00:52:15,035
but I'm actually a professional air guitarist.

550
00:52:15,235 --> 00:52:17,035
I know, I know.

551
00:52:17,035 --> 00:52:20,735
Surprise, shocker! Professional air guitarist here.

552
00:52:21,035 --> 00:52:22,735
Look out!

553
00:52:23,035 --> 00:52:27,235
Anyhoo, now it's time for an announcement!

554
00:52:27,435 --> 00:52:33,435
Everyone, let's call for our favorite four-legged friend, Bobby!

555
00:52:33,735 --> 00:52:37,035
Three, two, one, Bobby!

556
00:52:37,235 --> 00:52:41,235
Come here, Bobby! You're such a good boy. You're a good boy!

557
00:52:41,235 --> 00:52:45,735
Yeah! Show yourself to the camera. Do a little twirl or something, yeah.

558
00:52:45,735 --> 00:52:49,035
Oh, you're so cute! Wait a minute, what the freak?

559
00:52:49,035 --> 00:52:54,035
Bobby! Wait, should we...

560
00:52:54,035 --> 00:52:56,735
Come here, come here, come here.

561
00:52:56,735 --> 00:52:58,235
Up we get.

562
00:52:58,235 --> 00:53:02,735
Eyes, he's such a little cheeky guy, little cheeky guy.

563
00:53:03,035 --> 00:53:05,235
Oh golly!

564
00:53:05,435 --> 00:53:10,735
Well, as you can see on Bobby's head, the announcement is...

565
00:53:10,735 --> 00:53:13,235
Merchandise!

566
00:53:13,235 --> 00:53:16,235
Oh my goodness, we have this!

567
00:53:16,235 --> 00:53:19,035
Ta-da!

568
00:53:19,235 --> 00:53:25,235
Wow! A paper knife, letter opener inspired by my sword Thorn.

569
00:53:25,235 --> 00:53:31,235
A set product that includes an acrylic stand where you can plop your mini Thorn into.

570
00:53:31,235 --> 00:53:34,735
It looks real cool on your desk, and you'll get all the maidens.

571
00:53:34,735 --> 00:53:40,735
I should know, a lot of them have visited my dressing room to see the prototype.

572
00:53:41,035 --> 00:53:44,435
And that's no lie, it's pretty awesome!

573
00:53:44,435 --> 00:53:49,235
And also, the sales dates will be after the Justice collaboration stream.

574
00:53:49,235 --> 00:53:55,235
So once that's all done and dusted, it'll be out there on the shop.

575
00:53:55,235 --> 00:53:58,235
And that concludes the merchandise.

576
00:53:58,235 --> 00:54:01,235
Thank you, Bobby. Everybody thank Bobby.

577
00:54:01,235 --> 00:54:06,235
Thank you, Bobby! Thank you so much. You're such a good boy, you're such a good boy, yes you are, yes you are.

578
00:54:06,235 --> 00:54:10,235
All right, back to the Duke and the Queen Mother you go.

579
00:54:12,735 --> 00:54:18,235
Oh gosh, I honestly can't believe it. Time has flown.

580
00:54:18,235 --> 00:54:26,235
And it's already time for our last, final seventh song, seven!

581
00:54:26,235 --> 00:54:32,235
This has been quite the journey and a half. So before I end, I just want to thank everyone.

582
00:54:32,235 --> 00:54:37,235
The cast, our wonderful guests, the crew, managers, the director,

583
00:54:37,235 --> 00:54:42,235
thank you so much. Thank you for your hard work, thank you, thank you so much.

584
00:54:42,235 --> 00:54:47,735
And of course, my friends, my family, my beautiful kingdom,

585
00:54:47,735 --> 00:54:52,735
thanks for supporting me so much. I wouldn't be standing here right now,

586
00:54:52,735 --> 00:54:59,235
not only do I get to fight for justice, but with my wonderful girlies, Raora, Gigi...

587
00:55:00,856 --> 00:55:02,056
...see... and Cecilia...

588
00:55:02,056 --> 00:55:03,356
But I also get to do what I love.

589
00:55:03,356 --> 00:55:05,356
So thank you so much.

590
00:55:05,356 --> 00:55:07,656
I get to give the gift of smiles...

591
00:55:07,656 --> 00:55:11,056
...and strength for the art of performance and singing.

592
00:55:11,256 --> 00:55:13,456
I hope I can do this forever...

593
00:55:13,456 --> 00:55:17,056
...and we can keep spreading smiles throughout the realms together.

594
00:55:17,056 --> 00:55:19,656
That would make me so happy!

595
00:55:20,256 --> 00:55:22,256
Anyway, before the allergies hit me too much...

596
00:55:22,256 --> 00:55:24,656
...let me just move my stand.

597
00:55:24,656 --> 00:55:26,256
Woah...

598
00:55:26,756 --> 00:55:29,556
The allergies, guys! The allergies!

599
00:55:29,556 --> 00:55:31,056
I can't stand this stand!

600
00:55:31,056 --> 00:55:33,256
It must get out of the way!

601
00:55:33,456 --> 00:55:35,256
Don't mind me!

602
00:55:36,256 --> 00:55:38,456
All right. Uh, wait a minute.

603
00:55:38,856 --> 00:55:41,756
Before I do my last tune...

604
00:55:41,756 --> 00:55:45,256
...we got to bring back my beautiful backing dancers, right?

605
00:55:46,256 --> 00:55:49,256
Come on! Flame on!

606
00:55:51,056 --> 00:55:52,656
And they're back!

607
00:55:54,656 --> 00:55:55,856
Are you ready?

608
00:55:55,856 --> 00:55:57,256
Are you ready?

609
00:55:57,256 --> 00:55:59,256
Yes, yes, yes!

610
00:55:59,256 --> 00:56:03,456
And now, for our final song...

611
00:56:03,456 --> 00:56:05,656
...please listen to "Hero too".

612
00:56:05,656 --> 00:56:06,856
Hands up!

613
00:56:06,856 --> 00:56:08,056
I want to be an idol...

614
00:56:08,056 --> 00:56:10,256
...and a hero for all of you too!

615
00:56:10,256 --> 00:56:11,756
Let's go!

616
00:56:18,756 --> 00:56:22,056
Onwards and upwards! Huzzah!

617
00:56:22,256 --> 00:56:23,956
What am I to be?

618
00:56:23,956 --> 00:56:25,756
What is my calling?

619
00:56:25,756 --> 00:56:29,056
I gave up giving up, I'm ready to go

620
00:56:31,456 --> 00:56:33,456
The future's left unseen

621
00:56:33,456 --> 00:56:35,256
It all depends on me

622
00:56:35,256 --> 00:56:41,456
Put it on the line to follow my dream, yeah

623
00:56:41,456 --> 00:56:44,056
Tried all my life

624
00:56:44,056 --> 00:56:47,256
I've tried to find

625
00:56:47,256 --> 00:56:53,256
Something that makes me hold on and never let go

626
00:56:53,256 --> 00:56:54,856
Oh!

627
00:56:54,856 --> 00:56:58,456
Hero too, I am a hero too

628
00:56:58,456 --> 00:57:04,256
My heart is set and I won't back down

629
00:57:04,256 --> 00:57:08,256
Hero too, strength doesn't make a hero

630
00:57:08,256 --> 00:57:13,256
True heroes stand up for what they believe

631
00:57:13,256 --> 00:57:17,056
So wait and see

632
00:57:17,056 --> 00:57:18,056
Yeah!

633
00:57:18,056 --> 00:57:21,256
So wait and see

634
00:57:24,256 --> 00:57:26,256
What do they think of me?

635
00:57:26,256 --> 00:57:28,256
Who do they think I'll be?

636
00:57:28,256 --> 00:57:31,056
